AB  -  Random Prospective Study non‐blinded with 144 diabetics patients designated to myocardial revascularization with cardiopulmonary bypass . 72 patients will be randomly set to usual treatment provided by health care service and 72 patients will be randomly assigned treatment based on ISGLT2 (Empaglifozin). Patients will receive treatment as set for 3 months until 3 days prior to surgery. Creatinine levels will be measured immediately after surgery and in the following 3 days in post‐op. To evaluate the possibility to reduce the acute kidney injury in a randomized group treated with therapy based on ISGLT2.
